  "question": {
    "text": "A transverse wave is represented by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cm</mi></math>. The value of wavelength (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) for which the wave velocity becomes equal to the maximum particle velocity, will be"
  },
